Welcome to the '''The Adonia Lore Online Database (TALOD)'''. We are an independent collective of thinkers, creators, and lifelong companions dedicated to exploring the intricate tapestries of [[Adonia]] and the limitless possibilities of our shared imagination.

While the primary records of our planet often reflect a meticulous focus on city-building and urban architecture, the heart of TALOD beats for something far deeper. We are not a formal union or a public organization of the [[Adonia|Adonian]] government; rather, we are an unbreakable circle of friends. Our foundation is built upon a rare degree of mutual trust and collective history—a bond that is as momentous as it is intimate. Within this archive, every project and every detail of our world is a labor of love, protected by a shared commitment to excellence and loyalty.

This database has evolved to reflect the true depth of our home. Beyond the blueprints and cityscapes of the major [[Adonia]] hubs, we now document the lived experiences of our planet—the stories of the people, the nuances of tradition, and the small details that bring the culture of [[Adonia]] to life. We invite you to explore this archive of our shared journey, though please understand that our gates remain closed to new membership to preserve the sanctity of our fellowship.

On this platform, trust is our only currency, and our work is a testament to the power of a dedicated few. Information regarding individuals, societal customs, and non-architectural lore can now be found within these pages as we expand our understanding of [[Adonia]].